{"work_id":"tirumbippaar","target_language":"en","canonical_scene":63,"scene_status":"verified","unit_count":22,"units":[{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s063-u001","kind":"stage-direction","status":"verified","source":{"page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":79,"printed_page":71}]},"translation":{"english_text":"(Garudan Publishing House.)"}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s063-u002","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s063-d001","speaker_label":"புண்யகோடி","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":79,"printed_page":71}]},"translation":{"english_text":"The reason I'm saying all this is that the workers' demands must be fulfilled very soon. Thousands of workers are depending on us!"}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s063-u003","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s063-d002","speaker_label":"பரந்தாமன்","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":79,"printed_page":71}]},"translation":{"english_text":"Don't worry!"}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s063-u004","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s063-d003","speaker_label":"புண்யகோடி","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":79,"printed_page":71},{"pdf_page":80,"printed_page":72}]},"translation":{"english_text":"I know you're making plans for that! Even so, little by little some workers are joining that Pandiyan's party, talking about rationalism and all that, and looking down on us somewhat!"}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s063-u005","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s063-d004","speaker_label":"பரந்தாமன்","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":80,"printed_page":72}]},"translation":{"english_text":"Never mind. What can they do? He's lying in jail himself. Hmm. You go; I'll attend to everything immediately."}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s063-u006","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s063-d005","speaker_label":"புண்யகோடி","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":80,"printed_page":72}]},"translation":{"english_text":"I'll be going. Namaskaram. What, you...","notes":["The printed utterance ends unfinished at `என்ன, உங்களைத்தானே...`; no completion is supplied."]}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s063-u007","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s063-d006","speaker_label":"கருடன்","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":80,"printed_page":72}]},"translation":{"english_text":"Long live the working class!"}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s063-u008","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s063-d007","speaker_label":"பரந்தாமன்","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":80,"printed_page":72}]},"translation":{"english_text":"This fellow too keeps tormenting me with 'workers, workers.'"}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s063-u009","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s063-d008","speaker_label":"கருடன்","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":80,"printed_page":72}]},"translation":{"english_text":"Oh, keep quiet! Isn't it only behind that curtain that we can carry out everything we want!"}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s063-u010","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s063-d009","speaker_label":"பரந்தாமன்","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":80,"printed_page":72}]},"translation":{"english_text":"Everything we planned has succeeded, but that Usha matter was a failure!"}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s063-u011","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s063-d010","speaker_label":"கருடன்","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":80,"printed_page":72}]},"translation":{"english_text":"That won't matter at all! That's why I'm telling you: if you marry Usha, that enormous mill becomes yours! Thousands of workers become your slaves..."}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s063-u012","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s063-d011","speaker_label":"பரந்தாமன்","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":80,"printed_page":72}]},"translation":{"english_text":"A workers' leader marrying a mill owner's daughter...."}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s063-u013","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s063-d012","speaker_label":"கருடன்","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":80,"printed_page":72}]},"translation":{"english_text":"Don't you know 'mass psychology'? We can give a reason for that too."}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s063-u014","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s063-d013","speaker_label":"பரந்தாமன்","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":80,"printed_page":72}]},"translation":{"english_text":"We can. But speaking inconsistently from one time to the next..."}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s063-u015","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s063-d014","speaker_label":"கருடன்","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":80,"printed_page":72}]},"translation":{"english_text":"That's exactly how you must speak; otherwise what is the mark of a leader? Do as I say, man!"}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s063-u016","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s063-d015","speaker_label":"பரந்தாமன்","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":80,"printed_page":72}]},"translation":{"english_text":"I must marry Usha. That's all, isn't it!"}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s063-u017","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s063-d016","speaker_label":"கருடன்","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":81,"printed_page":73}]},"translation":{"english_text":"Yes! If you do that, it'll make many things convenient. First of all, we can expand our publishing house itself."}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s063-u018","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s063-d017","speaker_label":"பரந்தாமன்","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":81,"printed_page":73}]},"translation":{"english_text":"All right, we'll tell akka and have her ask for the bride."}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s063-u019","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s063-d018","speaker_label":"கருடன்","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":81,"printed_page":73}]},"translation":{"english_text":"Oh, why bring akka into all this? She's like a Saturn that objects to everything!"}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s063-u020","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s063-d019","speaker_label":"பரந்தாமன்","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":81,"printed_page":73}]},"translation":{"english_text":"Hey, Garuda! Watch your words! Don't say anything about my akka!"}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s063-u021","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s063-d020","speaker_label":"கருடன்","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":81,"printed_page":73}]},"translation":{"english_text":"Forgive me, forgive me! I was just testing..."},"notes":["The corrected dialogue corpus deliberately preserves the historical d020/d021 split for this single printed Garudan utterance so stable dialogue IDs are not renumbered."]}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s063-u022","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s063-d021","speaker_label":"கருடன்","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":81,"printed_page":73}]},"translation":{"english_text":"...how much love the sister has for her younger brother........"},"notes":["Continuation of the same printed Garudan utterance represented by stable source record d021."]}}]}